<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const viewingUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = viewingUser.fullName || 'Renter'; %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar-renter') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Renter workspace</p>
        <p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/profile" aria-label="Renter profile" title="Renter profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Application activity</p>
            <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Viewing detail</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Review viewing availability and the records required before an appointment can be displayed or changed.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-primary px-5 font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-lowest" href="/user/renter/applications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>Applications</a>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="viewing-availability-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">event_busy</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Service unavailable</p>
                <h2 id="viewing-availability-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">No viewing record is available</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A property record, submitted application, authorized participants, appointment store, scheduling workflow, and notification service are not connected. This page will not invent appointment details.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">0 scheduled viewings</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-outline bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center" aria-labelledby="viewing-empty-title">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">calendar_month</span>
              <h2 id="viewing-empty-title" class="mt-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">No viewing to display</h2>
              <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">There is no persisted viewing linked to this account. Missing data does not mean an appointment is requested, confirmed, changed, cancelled, missed, or completed.</p>
              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
                <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/renter/applications">Review applications</a>
                <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-outline-variant px-6 font-bold text-on-surface hover:border-primary" href="/user/renter/support">Viewing support</a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="viewing-foundations-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="viewing-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required viewing foundations</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Appointment details and controls can appear only after these server-owned records exist.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">home_work</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Saved property</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">An authorized listing with a stable property identity and current availability.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">assignment</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Related application</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A persisted application that proves renter, property, and landlord context.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">event_available</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Appointment lifecycle</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Requested, proposed, confirmed, changed, cancelled, missed, and completed states with timestamps.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">notifications_active</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Participant delivery</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Authorized host details, delivery outcomes, reminders, and change acknowledgements.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="viewing-lifecycle-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="viewing-lifecycle-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required viewing lifecycle</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Every transition needs authorization, durable history, and a clear result.</p></div>
              <ol class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">1</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Request and propose</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Validate property availability, participant roles, proposed times, timezone, and expiry.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">2</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Confirm and notify</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Store the accepted slot and notify each participant without exposing unnecessary personal data.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">3</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Change or cancel</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Require a reason, prevent conflicting updates, record the actor, and surface delivery failures.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">4</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Complete and retain</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Record completion or missed status and apply a defined retention and correction policy.</p></div></li>
              </ol>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Viewing guidance">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="viewing-actions-title">
              <h2 id="viewing-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Viewing actions</h2>
              <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Message host</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Request or confirm</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Reschedule</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Cancel</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Calendar export</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="viewing-safety-title">
              <h2 id="viewing-safety-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Before attending a viewing</h2>
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">
                <li>Do not travel until the property, address, time, host, and current status come from an authoritative appointment record.</li>
                <li>Do not send passwords, identity documents, payment details, access codes, or full application evidence through an unverified contact.</li>
                <li>Use the appropriate local emergency or property service for urgent safety concerns.</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="viewing-status-boundary-title">
              <h2 id="viewing-status-boundary-title" class="font-bold">Status boundary</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No appointment record means no viewing status. It must never be converted into a confirmed, cancelled, missed, or completed outcome.</p>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
